name: Background history retains typing, selected jobs and origin under bounded metadata pressure
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_history_loading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI || READY THE MAP RUN | ready
submit: campaign held
type: held history draft λ
require-live-snap: 25 held history draft λ | input-after-history-request
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_history_loading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART title
ask: Does requesting the saved investigation preserve the typed draft and disclose whether history is loading or available without presenting an empty workspace as a successful read?
require-live-snap: 30 held-1 | exact-history-ready
expect: held-2
expect: History partial
expect: held history draft λ
nav-mode:
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 held-2 | selected-recorded-job
expect: 0 total attempts
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 held-2 | refreshing-selected-job
expect: 0 total attempts
resize: 160x48
keys: Home
live-snap: history-job-160x48
resize: 96x89
keys: Home
live-snap: history-job-96x89
resize: 80x24
keys: Home
live-snap: history-job-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
live-snap: history-job-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: history-job-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: history-job-paged-40x12
expect: Job: held-2
expect: Jobs: 2
ask: Can the operator read the selected recorded job and unknown cost at six sizes while refresh retains identity, scroll and visible return controls?
resize: 120x36
submit: campaign held
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 20 COMMAND PALETTE | palette-during-history-refresh
ask: Does history completion leave the command palette in control rather than taking focus or starting work?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 30 held-2 | returned-to-recorded-job
expect: History partial
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_history_loading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI || READY THE MAP RUN | restarted
submit: campaign held
require-live-snap: 30 held-1 | recovered-history
expect: held-2
expect: History partial
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_history_loading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart recover the same unstarted investigation with truthful omissions and unknown spending, unchanged plans and zero requests or follow-up jobs?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
